        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 955MD, Clear Glass Knob With Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Clear Glass Knobset is the perfect way to make a statement about your sense of style. It exudes elegance and a quiet grace that can add a traditional feel to any door. It is paired with a round rose that does not take away from the sparkling beauty of the knob. The Classic Glass Knob With Round Rose is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors. The rose is available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Glass Knob With Round Roses:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 955MD Classic Glass Knob With Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic Glass Knob With Round Rose, Omnia 955MD",
                "description": "Clear Glass Knob With Modern Rose Omnia 955MD - The Clear Glass Knobset is the perfect way to make a statement about your sense of style. It exudes elegance and a quiet grace that can add a traditional feel to any door. It is paired with a round rose that does not take away from the sparkling beauty of the knob. The Classic Glass Knob With Round Rose is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors. The rose is available in 8 finishes.",
                "keywords": "OMN-955MD, Omnia 955MD Classic Glass Knob With Round Rose, Traditional knobsets, classic knobsets, omnia prodigy collections, solid brass door knobs,  passage knobs, privacy knobs, vintage knobs, Scalloped Glass Knobs, victorian glass knobs, Classic Glass Knob With Round Roses, Clear Glass Knobsets,"
